@startuml
title D3 Assessment Lifecycle — Purpose vs DeliveryMode vs Result (Design-Only)
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
hide methods
hide circle

' D3 FROZEN: assessmentType (purpose) is independent from deliveryMode (execution).
' No AssessmentSession entity. AssessmentResult is the sole persisted evidence.

enum assessmentType {
  DIAGNOSTIC
  EXIT
  RE_EVALUATION
}

enum deliveryMode {
  PLACEMENT
  JUMP
  STANDARD
}

class AssessmentResult {
  + id: UUID
  + learnerProfileId: UUID
  + targetLanguage: String
  + assessmentType: assessmentType
  + deliveryMode: deliveryMode
  + startedAt: Timestamp
  + completedAt: Timestamp
  + blueprintVersion: String
  + languageConfigVersion: String
  + responses: JSONB
  + skillOutputs: JSONB
  + stageData: JSONB
}

class SkillProfile {
  + four dimensions (Vocab/Grammar/Reading/Listening)
  + anchorLevel: PENDING VALIDATION
  + sourceAssessmentResultId: UUID
}

class LevelReadiness {
  + ADVANCE
  + ADVANCE_WITH_SUPPORT
  + REMEDIATE
}

state "NO_EVIDENCE" as s0
state "SELF_REPORTED\n(selfReportedLevel UNVERIFIED)" as s1
state "ASSESSED\n(SkillProfile + verifiedProficiency)" as s2
state "IN_LEARNING" as s3
state "APPRAISED\n(EXIT / RE_EVALUATION evidence)" as s4

[*] --> s0
s0 --> s1 : self-report / skip\n[deliveryMode independent]
s0 --> s2 : DIAGNOSTIC\n[PLACEMENT or STANDARD]\nemit AssessmentResult
s1 --> s2 : DIAGNOSTIC (later)\nemit AssessmentResult
s2 --> s3 : enter curriculumStartingPoint\n(provisional or verified)
s3 --> s4 : EXIT\nemit AssessmentResult\nreadiness input
s3 --> s4 : RE_EVALUATION\nemit AssessmentResult\nSkillProfile refresh
s4 --> s3 : continue learning\n(LevelReadiness appraisal required;\ncompletion alone never advances)

note right of s4
  **Entry vs post-learning (FROZEN):**
  - DIAGNOSTIC -> starting-point evidence
  - EXIT / RE_EVALUATION -> readiness-input evidence
  - DIAGNOSTIC result is never reused as EXIT appraisal
  - No completed-scope -> auto-advance edge exists
end note

AssessmentResult --> SkillProfile : produces snapshot
AssessmentResult --> LevelReadiness : readiness input (EXIT/RE_EVALUATION)

@enduml
